{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1374868-simplified-character-creation","id":1374868,"title":"Simplified Character Creation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-14T20:09:03-07:00","id":1374868,"title":"Simplified Character Creation","content":"<br /> So, in this time of plague, I'm trying to get a one-off game of vtr going with my roommates. One is super into the prep-work, the other doesn't want to put do a ton of work and more just wants to jump in and have fun.<br /> <br /> I also realized that I only have one character sheet printed out, and all the printers are in places that are closed. So I was trying to think of ways to save on writing, and make character creation faster for my rm.<br /> <br /> I have a couple of ideas, but what do you find takes up the most time in char creation for you? What's the most difficult for you? How would you consolidate things?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24634-dubiousruffian","name":"DubiousRuffian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"210"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-14T20:36:17-07:00","id":1374872,"title":"","content":"I would just have them fill out a basic clan thing. Character creation isn't hard except for choosing beginning merits. just ask him what type of concept he wants. smooth talker. go Daeva or Ventrue. Sneaky sneak, go mekhet. stick within the clan diciplines. then just give them a list of merits that they might choose. also nothing wrong with just building up the staple merits like resources, safe place, herd, feeding ground. stuff like that. gives him some good plot hooks and maybe some npcs for you to build off of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-15T07:38:55-07:00","id":1374920,"title":"","content":"Make merits be something they earn during the intro.<br /> Start then with 2 points in the clan exclusive discipline and then make them earn their last point in another discipline during the intro.<br /> <br /> Or, pick up Danse Macabre Story and play through it with the already created characters?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24020-mateus","name":"Mateus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24020_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-15T11:30:34-07:00","id":1374946,"title":"","content":"I\u2019ll echo cutting Merits. Everything else is pretty straightforward and quick, but it takes a lot of going back and forth to distribute those 10 dots. They\u2019re also something newer players tend to forget about in-game, as they\u2019re trying to figure out their new powers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-15T11:48:36-07:00","id":1374951,"title":"","content":"If it's the first time they play, then nixing Merits isn't a bad idea. If they're experienced, then getting rid of Merits could be pretty boring. In that case you might want to put together a few &quot;Merit packs&quot; they could choose from, representing the character's background in some way.<br /> Also, for one shots I find that ready made characters works well. It's certainly more work for you, but you get more control over balance and know their available tools much better. Preferably there should be more characters to choose from than players, so that everyone feels they've made a choice and someone won't end up with the remaining character. Some people are okay just playing the character they've been assigned, but I think having to make a choice in the matter will lead to more investment in the character and game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}